{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45558","headline":"胡无人 · 贯休","name":"胡无人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霍嫖姚，赵充国，天子将之平朔漠。\n肉胡之肉，烬胡帐幄。\n千里万里，唯留胡之空壳。\n边风萧萧，榆叶初落。\n杀气昼赤，枯骨夜哭。\n将军既立殊勳，遂有胡无人曲。\n我闻之，天子富有四海。\n德被无垠，但令一物得所。\n八表来宾，亦何必令彼胡无人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45558.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45558","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}